## Working style

Small reviewable steps with plain-language reasons (the maintainer explains this system to others). Prefer one complete file over fragments when a whole file is requested. Verify before delivering; include the verification evidence; say plainly what could not be verified. Adding captures/counties/properties is DATA-ONLY by design — prefer data changes over code changes when both work.
